        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: south-east England, Earlswood, Eastern Caribbean\n- Airports: the airport next to Earlswood, the replaced earlier airport\n- Events: the 1921 SNETA Farman Goliath ditching\n\nFacts:\n- The airport described is in south-east England and is next to the suburb of Earlswood.\n- This airport replaced an earlier airport that was the departure point for the 1921 SNETA Farman Goliath ditching.\n- The airport is said to rank as the 8th busiest airport in the Eastern Caribbean.",
